        {
          "id": 3153748127,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Those are not the same MIBs...\n\n- **IANA-ITU-ALARM-TC-MIB**: Contains the IANAItuProbableCause Textual Convention (TC), which is designed to be updated by IANA as new alarm causes are added.\n- **IETF ITU-ALARM-TC-MIB**: Contains fixed textual conventions (ItuPerceivedSeverity, ItuTrendIndication) based on ITU-T recommendations (M.3100/X.733), such as cleared, critical, or major.\n\n[ITU-ALARM-TC-MIB](https://mibs.observium.org/mib/ITU-ALARM-TC-MIB/)\n\n[IANA-ITU-ALARM-TC-MIB](https://mibs.observium.org/mib/IANA-ITU-ALARM-TC-MIB/)",
          "author": {
            "id": 20971927,
            "username": "rtommy",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Tamas Regos",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/20971927/avatar.png?v=1788090511",
